  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalation in kinetic engagements spurs retaliatory and opportunistic cyber operations and targeting of critical infrastructure that increase leaks, tampering, and misuse of AI systems, raising observed safety and security incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
