  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained reductions in regional oil and gas flows trigger immediate global oil-price spikes and higher inflation expectations, causing investors to demand higher long-term sovereign yields as compensation for elevated inflation and risk.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
</edge>
