  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher sustained Middle East oil and gas transit volumes ease global price pressure, reducing energy windfalls to Russia and thereby lowering the immediate rate at which Moscow can allocate extra revenue toward procurement and sustainment for the Ukraine war.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
