<edge source="iran_regional_escalation::sanctions_enforcement" target="energy_chokepoints::oil_spot_price" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter enforcement of sanctions restricts buyers, payment and insurance channels for targeted exporters and reduces effective available supply to spot markets, directly raising near‑term physical price levels through supply tightness and risk premia.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">energy_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_regional_escalation::sanctions_enforcement" target="global_bond_rate_shock::intervention_activity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharper, more operationally rigorous sanctions that impede cross-border payments and dollar clearing produce funding dislocations and asset-price dislocations that compel central banks and authorities to execute targeted market interventions (FX swaps, repo operations, asset purchases) to restore functioning.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_regional_escalation::sanctions_enforcement" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::national_security_pressu" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger, more operational sanctions against Iranian entities provoke U.S. and allied agencies to broaden export controls and scrutiny of third‑party (including Chinese) tech actors to prevent sanction circumvention, raising national‑security pressure on AI-related data and hardware flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
