  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Sudden spikes in tanker freight rates increase working-capital needs and collateral calls for traders and non-bank intermediaries, forcing deleveraging that reduces dealer inventory and widens bid–ask spreads in bond markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
