  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp rises in tanker freight rates force rerouting, slow‑steaming and reallocation of shipping capacity, producing delays and higher costs that translate into immediate disruptions across energy and industrial supply chains.</data>
