  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy rates raise short‑term dollar funding and working‑capital costs for shipowners and charterers, forcing them to pass on higher financing and idle‑time costs through increased freight rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">energy_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
