  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy rates increase working‑capital and trade‑finance costs for domestic and international defense contractors and suppliers, slowing production and deliveries and thereby depleting available munitions inventories over procurement cycles.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
